sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Buyer
    participant p1 as Checkout API
    participant p2 as Inventory DB
    participant p3 as Payment PSP
    participant p4 as Order DB
    participant p5 as Outbox Worker
    p0->>p1: Checkout with idempotency key
    p1->>p2: Atomic stock hold
    p2->>p1: Hold confirmed
    p1->>p3: Authorize with stable key
    p3->>p1: Authorization outcome
    p1->>p4: Commit order and outbox together
    p1->>p0: Accepted, order reference
    p4->>p5: Publish committed fulfillment event
